{"ref": "Shabbat 63a:9", "heRef": "שבת ס״ג א:ט׳", "sectionRef": "Shabbat 63a", "indexTitle": "Shabbat", "heIndexTitle": "שבת", "categories": ["Talmud", "Bavli", "Seder Moed"], "next": "Shabbat 63b", "sectionNames": ["Daf", "Line"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99", "text": "ר' אליעזר אומר תכשיטין הן לו: תניא אמרו לו לרבי אליעזר וכי מאחר דתכשיטין הן לו מפני מה הן בטלין לימות המשיח אמר להן לפי שאינן צריכין שנאמר (ישעיהו ב, ד) לא ישא גוי אל גוי חרב ותהוי לנוי בעלמא אמר אביי מידי דהוה אשרגא בטיהרא"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org", "text": "\"Rabbi Eliezer says they are ornaments\" It was taught (in a baraita): They said in response to Rabbi Eliezer: If these weapons are ornaments for him, why are they nullified in the time of Mashiach? He said to them: Because they will not be needed then. As it says: (Isaiah 2:4) \"Nation shall not lift up sword against nation\" and they will be for mere decoration. Abaye said: It would be like a candle at noon - and this is in disagreement with Shmuel. For Shmuel said:"}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - English", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.com/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://www.korenpub.com/koren_en_usd/koren/talmud/koren-talmud-bavli-no/mskt-wbt-hlq-a.html"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "german", "actualLanguage": "de", "versionTitle": "Talmud Bavli. German trans. by Lazarus Goldschmidt, 1929 [de]", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001042448/NLI"}]}